{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-615", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/615", "wordCount": 1496, "segments": [{"start": 6.0, "text": "Hello. I'm Ben Harry from the"}, {"start": 8.0, "text": "Game Center Engineering team."}, {"start": 9.0, "text": "In this presentation, I'm going"}, {"start": 12.0, "text": "to talk about Game Center player"}, {"start": 13.0, "text": "identifiers."}, {"start": 16.0, "text": "To get started, I'm going to"}, {"start": 17.0, "text": "give you a brief overview of"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "what Game Center offers to the"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "players of your games."}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "Game Center is a social gaming"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "network that allows players to"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "track their best scores on"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "leaderboards, view their"}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "achievements earned playing your"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "games, challenge their friends"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "to complete an achievement or to"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "beat a leaderboard score, and"}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "play either real-time or"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "turn-based multiplayer games"}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "with their friends."}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "At the heart of Game Center"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "games are the players."}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "Players are represented by"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "objects that contain unique"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "information that differentiate"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "one player from another."}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "The object used to represent"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "Game Center players is the"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "GKPlayer."}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "Every GKPlayer has a unique"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "nickname accessed by the alias"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "property."}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "A player may also choose an"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "avatar image that will be used"}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "within Game Center UIs."}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "In addition, each Game Center"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "user has a unique static"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "identifier that remains the same"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "across all games that the player"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "plays."}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "You may use this identifier to"}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "store per-player information."}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "Let me now talk about how a"}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "player static identifier"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "currently works in Game Center."}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "You may already be familiar with"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "this, but let us consider this"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "example in case you need to"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "refresh your memory."}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "Here we have two teams, Team A"}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "and Team B."}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "In this presentation, I will be"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "using the term team to represent"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "a development team that releases"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "a game to the App Store using"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "App Store Connect."}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "So, I have been playing two"}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "games from Team A and I also"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "really enjoy the game from Team"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "B."}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "As we see, my static Game Center"}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "identifier is P123."}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "Each of these games we'll see"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "the same value from my"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "identifier P123."}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "No matter which game I play, I"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "had the same static identifier."}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "Going forward, we now want to"}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "increase privacy by introducing"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "new player identifiers that are"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "scoped to the either the team or"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "the game itself."}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "So let's begin with the first of"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "these new identifiers, the team"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "player ID."}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "Remember that team refers to the"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "development team that releases a"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "game to the App Store."}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "Again, consider Team A and Team"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "B along with the same games from"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "before."}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "Notice that now I have two"}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "different identifiers."}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "When I play either game from"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "Team A, the value of my team"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "player ID will be T11."}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "When I play the game from Team"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "B, the value of my team player"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "ID will be T22."}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "This means that the value of my"}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "team player ID scoped to the"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "team that releases the game I"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "play."}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "This is an improvement to player"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "privacy as Team A will only know"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "my team player ID as T11, and"}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "Team B will only know my team"}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "player ID as T22."}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "So this is the team player ID."}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "I now want to tell you about our"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "other new player identifier, the"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "game player ID."}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "The game player ID is unique per"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "game per player."}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "This means that my game player"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "ID is unique to each game that I"}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "play."}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "Its value is also independent"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "from the team that releases the"}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "game."}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "Let us go back to our familiar"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "teams, Team A and Team B."}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "As you can see here, my game"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "player ID is different for each"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "game that I play, regardless of"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "which team has released the"}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "game."}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "To further show how a game"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "player ID is independent from"}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "the team, let's consider the"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "case when a game is transferred"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "from one team to another."}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "I am now going to show you what"}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "happens to my scoped identifiers"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "when Game 2 is transferred from"}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "Team A to Team B."}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "Let's say Team A transfers"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "ownership of Game 2 to Team B."}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "Now, when I play Game 2, my game"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "player ID for Game 2 remains"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "unchanged."}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "My game player ID for Game 2"}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "persisted with the game and is"}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "independent of the team."}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "Now, you may have also noticed"}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "something about my team player"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "ID for Game 2."}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "My team player ID for Game 2"}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "took on the value for Team B"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "since it is now released to the"}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "App Store by Team B."}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "So we have come to the scoping"}, {"start": 289.0, "text": "of the new Game Center"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "identifiers and also what"}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "happens to these identifiers"}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "when game ownership is"}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "transferred."}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "I am now going to talk about how"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "you may use the scope"}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "identifiers in the games that"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "you develop."}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "As you have seen, we have added"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "two new scope identifiers to the"}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "GKPlayer, the team player ID and"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "the game player ID."}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "The team player ID and game"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "player ID have been introduced"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "with the goal of increasing"}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "player privacy, which aligned to"}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "the Apple's commitment to"}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "protecting the privacy of our"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "users."}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "This new identifiers replaced"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "the existing static identifier"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "or player ID on a GKPlayer."}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "The playerID property is now"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "deprecated."}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "So I encourage you to start"}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "using these new scope"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "identifiers today."}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "As I mentioned earlier, the team"}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "player ID and game player ID"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "have been introduced to replace"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "the static player ID."}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "If you don't query the player ID"}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "in your games, then you will not"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "need to make any changes."}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "If you do query the player ID,"}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "you'll need to switch to the new"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "scoped identifiers."}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "You'll be using the team player"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "ID in most cases."}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "Likewise, if you currently use"}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "the static player ID to save"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "game data, you should move to"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "the team scoped ID."}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "Doing so will handle the"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "situation in the device you"}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "shared by multiple Game Center"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "players."}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "For those of you who may be"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "persisting the static player ID"}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "in your own back end system, you"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "should also update to the new"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "scoped identifiers."}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "You can do this any time after a"}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "successful authentication."}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "Next, let me show you how scoped"}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "identifiers look for their local"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "player as compared to non-local"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "players."}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "As you probably know, the"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "GKLocalPlayer is the object that"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "represents the authenticated"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "Game Center player on a device."}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "At any given time, only one"}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "player may be authenticated."}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "And the GKLocalPlayer has a"}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "persistent team player ID and"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "game player ID."}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "But what about the GKPlayer?"}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "A GKPlayer object provides"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "information about other players."}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "These are non-local players and"}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "may be found in leaderboards"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "recently played lists"}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "multiplayer matches and so"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "forth."}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "The scoped identifiers for"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "GKPlayers will be instance based"}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "on the context in which they are"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "used."}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "For example, their scope to each"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "instance of a leaderboard or"}, {"start": 442.0, "text": "each instance of a multiplayer"}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "match, which means that you"}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "cannot count on them to persist"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "in subsequent matches."}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "Let's say you have your own"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "player accounting system."}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "In which case, you'll be loading"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "the corresponding GKPlayer"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "objects."}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "To do this, use the"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "loadPlayersForIdentifiers:"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "withCompletionHandler method"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "found on GKPlayer."}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "You may use either the team"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "player ID or the game player ID"}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "for the identifiers."}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "When you use the new"}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "identifiers, there is a very"}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "rare case where the scoped"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "identifiers will not be"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "available."}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "So what should you do if the"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "scoped identifiers are not"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "available?"}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "Usually, when a player launches"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "one of your games, the scoped"}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "identifiers for the local player"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "will be available after"}, {"start": 491.0, "text": "successful authentication."}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "However, there is a slim chance"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "that the scoped identifiers may"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "not be available."}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "For this case, we've added a new"}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "API to GKPlayer."}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "Scoped IDs are persistent."}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "This property will be false if"}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "they are not available."}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "This means that you'll need to"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "check this property before using"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "the team player ID or game"}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "player ID for the local player."}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "So let's tie all this"}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "information together by"}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "considering an example of using"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "the scoped identifiers after"}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "successful authentication."}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "As you know, when the"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "authenticate handler returns,"}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "you need to check if Game Center"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "has returned you a view"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "controller."}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "If so, then you present the view"}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "controller when convenient."}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "If there is no view controller"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "and the local player has"}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "successfully authenticated, then"}, {"start": 545.0, "text": "you will be able to use the"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "scoped identifiers after first"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "checking the scoped IDs are a"}, {"start": 549.0, "text": "persistent value."}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "If you are persisting the player"}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "ID in your own back end system,"}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "now is when you should convert"}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "from the old static identifier"}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "to the new scope identifiers."}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "I will now wrap up by"}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "summarizing what I have"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "presented today."}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "Game Center is introducing new"}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "scoped identifiers with the goal"}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "of increasing player privacy."}, {"start": 573.0, "text": "A player's team player ID is"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "scoped to your development team."}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "A player's game player ID is"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "scoped to a game and will"}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "persist with that game if it is"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "transferred from one developer"}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "to another."}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "Use these new scoped identifiers"}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "in Game Center APIs as you will"}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "use the player ID."}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "Both of these identifiers are"}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "available now so start using"}, {"start": 595.0, "text": "them today."}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "For more information on this"}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "presentation, please visit the"}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "link shown here."}]}
